msgid "What's new in Rebel 1.0"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Rebel Engine and Rebel Editor were forked from Godot Engine in 2023; so that "
"they can be developed with different priorities. The Rebel development "
"philosophy is:"
msgstr ""

msgid "Focus on the needs of the game developer before the engine developer"
msgstr ""

msgid "Fix bugs before writing new code"
msgstr ""

msgid "Write maintainable code that follows C++ Core Guidelines"
msgstr ""

msgid "Reduce existing technical debt"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Rebel was forked from Godot Engine 3.4.5. This version was chosen as the "
"basis for Rebel, because it was a stable and reliable version used to "
"develop many published games. Rebel 1.0 remains fully compatible with Godot "
"Engine 3.4.5. Godot projects created with Godot Engine 3.4.5 can be imported "
"and edited in Rebel Editor."
msgstr ""

msgid "Rebel Engine and Rebel Editor 1.0 include the following updates:"
